&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Enterprise SaaS Sales Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable track record of successfully selling complex enterprise SaaS products to large organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
